senses.gloss:
nala
(1) Phragmites karka Trin. ex Steud. (HK; Bpn, guḍūcyādivarga 157;
Raison; Sharma) = P. maxima Blatter et McCann in parte (Bt.; Chopra;
KB 4, p. 2695-2696) = Arundo karka Retz. = A. tibialis Roxb. (see Hoo-
ker 7, p. 304);
(2) A. donax Linn. (Bpn, guḍūcyādivarga 157; DGV 2-3, p. 541-542) =
Amphidonax bengalensis Nees ex Steud. (see Hooker 7, p. 302-303) (Am-
phidonax karka, mentioned by HK, is not to be found in Hooker);
(3) = (deva)nā̆la: Lobelia nicotianaefolia Heyne (Bpn, guḍūcyādi-
varga 157; Chopra; WIRM 6, p. 161; V. 5, p. 118).
